identification of the most important sensors, for which we investigate a set of search and optimization approaches. Furthermore, GSP enables the detection of specific graph signal patterns (mode shapes), capturing physical functional properties of the sensors in the applied complex network. In addition, we show the efficacy of applying GNNs for strain prediction on this kind of data.", "作者": ["Stefan Bloemheuvel", "Jurgen van den Hoogen", "Martin Atzmueller"], "年份": 2021, "发表位置": "arXiv"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/75d72ffec9284b7d8ed63c845deb4a9b/runs", "run_id": "run_57e54af4e1eb46f3ad2069c17827ae65", "session_key": "75d72ffec9284b7d8ed63c845deb4a9b", "turn_id": "0eb24b0b-c5fd-4e20-b8b3-787af4d0e60e"}
