or image classification and the ANN achieves an accuracy of 98.1% for surface detection. The decreased accuracy in the CNN is due to the false positive detection, however false positives are tolerated whereas false negatives are not. The false negative detection for both CNN and ANN in the two-step scheme are 0%.", "作者": ["Alice Yi Yang", "Ling Cheng"], "年份": 2020, "发表位置": "arXiv"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/75d72ffec9284b7d8ed63c845deb4a9b/runs", "run_id": "run_57e54af4e1eb46f3ad2069c17827ae65", "session_key": "75d72ffec9284b7d8ed63c845deb4a9b", "turn_id": "0eb24b0b-c5fd-4e20-b8b3-787af4d0e60e"}
