amos National Laboratory (LANL). The outcomes show that the new CNN algorithm is very accurate in spotting structural degradation in the examined structure.", "作者": ["Ishan Pathak", "Ishan Jha", "Aditya Sadana", "Basuraj Bhowmik"], "年份": 2023, "发表位置": "arXiv"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/75d72ffec9284b7d8ed63c845deb4a9b/runs", "run_id": "run_57e54af4e1eb46f3ad2069c17827ae65", "session_key": "75d72ffec9284b7d8ed63c845deb4a9b", "turn_id": "0eb24b0b-c5fd-4e20-b8b3-787af4d0e60e"}
